> 2. **Data Contents**: Confirm whether your `daygrow` data still contains valid, non-missing values. Ensure there are no `NaN` or `Inf` values among the inputs. Such entries can disrupt the behavior of `KDTree`. For an increased data size, the chance of containing extreme or disruptive values goes up.
